  "body": "Welcome to this impressive contemporary residence at 545 Beach Road, Murrays Bay — offering exceptional space, flexibility and a lifestyle perfectly designed for modern family living.\r\n\r\nSet on a 418sqm (approx.) freehold site, this substantial home boasts approximately 302sqm of floor area, featuring 5 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms thoughtfully arranged across three levels.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor offers outstanding versatility, with two bedrooms and a separate living area, complete with its own independent access — ideal for extended family, teenagers, guests or potential home-and-income flexibility. A private deck seamlessly connects the indoor and outdoor spaces, creating a peaceful area to relax and entertain.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the spacious main living area provides plenty of room for the whole family. The modern designer kitchen is beautifully appointed with premium German appliances, generous storage and excellent functionality — making it the heart of the home.\r\n\r\nThe top level features three further bedrooms with expansive floor-to-ceiling windows, allowing natural light to flood in while offering beautiful local views to enjoy every day.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n\r\n• 418sqm (approx.) land | 302sqm (approx.) floor area\r\n• 5 bedrooms | 3 bathrooms\r\n• Flexible multi-level layout ideal for large or extended families\r\n• Ground-floor accommodation with separate entrance\r\n• Private deck with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Spacious family living area\r\n• Modern kitchen with premium German appliances\r\n• Abundant storage throughout\r\n• Floor-to-ceiling windows and beautiful local views\r\n• Minutes to shopping, motorway access and everyday amenities\r\n\r\nOutstanding School Zones\r\nEducation is a major highlight of this exceptional location. Your family can enjoy access to highly sought-after schools from primary through to secondary level, including:\r\n\r\nRangitoto College\r\nNorthcross Intermediate\r\nMurrays Bay Intermediate\r\nMurrays Bay School\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in popular Murrays Bay, this home offers the ideal combination of generous family living, modern comfort, flexible accommodation and exceptional educational opportunities.\r\n\r\nDon't miss the opportunity to secure a spacious family home in one of the North Shore's most desirable locations. Contact us today for further information or to arrange your viewing.",
